WEBVTT

00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:03.726
to attain a modern education
away from my home.

00:01:03.726 --> 00:01:08.564
After some years, I returned home

00:01:08.606 --> 00:01:10.483
to be with my people.

00:01:11.275 --> 00:01:13.402
I returned home

00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:16.239
importantly, to be with my people

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:21.119
to resist against a mining company
that was proposing to extract minerals

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.537
in the Frieda River,

00:01:22.578 --> 00:01:27.166
which is a major tributary
to the Sepik River,

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.503
which is the longest river
in Papua New Guinea.